wordsegment (Rust port)

This crate is a Rust translation of the Python package wordsegment 1.3.1
(http://www.grantjenks.com/docs/wordsegment/), Copyright 2018 Grant Jenks,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. wordsegment is based on code
from the chapter "Natural Language Corpus Data" from the book "Beautiful Data"
(Segaran and Hammerbacher, 2009), Copyright (c) 2008-2009 by Peter Norvig.

The source code was translated from Python to Rust for the ortts project. The
data files in data/ (unigrams.txt, bigrams.txt, words.txt) are copied
unmodified from the wordsegment 1.3.1 distribution.
